{
  "page": "RogueSquadron64Recomp.html",
  "header": [
    "Recorded by RogueSquadron64Recomp-web's tools/shader_plan.json with N64Recomp-browser's tools/record_shaders.mjs, in",
    "headless Chrome: section 0 is the boot (the launcher, the intro, SELECT GAME, ENTER NAME and AVAILABLE CRAFT, each",
    "press repeated until the screen word at 0x800CDAC4 moves), then a section a mission of the sixteen, set at AVAILABLE",
    "CRAFT as the port's own --boot-target level:N does: A on the craft, its chapter's crawl for the first of each",
    "chapter, its opening cinematic and about 25 s of flying, with blasters, a",
    "missile and the pause menu. Not played: the three bonus missions, the options, the passcodes, a mission's end and",
    "its debriefing; a shader they need that the list lacks draws with the ubershader in Chrome until it is built behind",
    "the game, and in Firefox it is built before the next frame and remembered for the next visit."
  ],
